cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this module, please cite it and the underlying methods as below."
title: "sta425_de: DESeq2, edgeR, limma-voom and Wilcoxon DE entrypoints"
abstract: >-
  Omnibenchmark DE module with one entrypoint per method. Each takes a raw count
  table and sample sheet for a two-condition comparison (WT vs snf2) and writes
  per-gene log2 fold changes, p-values and BH-adjusted p-values in a shared format.
